which means that climate change

00:43:50.430 --> 00:43:55.230
will actually save
lives in rich countries.

00:43:55.230 --> 00:43:58.230
So just so that you don't
get the message that you,

00:43:58.230 --> 00:44:00.600
we have nothing to worry
about in rich countries,

00:44:00.600 --> 00:44:01.770
this is just temperature

00:44:01.770 --> 00:44:03.360
that there is all these other things,

00:44:03.360 --> 00:44:05.580
there will be damage in those countries,

00:44:05.580 --> 00:44:08.040
but from temperature alone, actually,

