00:58:30.630 --> 00:58:34.110
So the way it works,
there are two pillars,

00:58:34.110 --> 00:58:36.480
but pillar two is the
one that raise monies.

00:58:36.480 --> 00:58:39.270
So for example, if a
German company pays 10%

00:58:39.270 --> 00:58:41.130
of their profits in Singapore,

00:58:41.130 --> 00:58:43.140
Germany will collect the extra 5%.

00:58:43.140 --> 00:58:45.633
So everyone gets to, gets to 15.

00:58:47.349 --> 00:58:51.480
So my proposal for this is to,

