01:25:13.856 --> 01:25:16.350
and still the point that you know,

01:25:16.350 --> 01:25:20.610
below 1.9 it's relatively
little carbon this point

01:25:20.610 --> 01:25:23.040
is to me pretty, pretty strong.

01:25:23.040 --> 01:25:26.310
The question really is what
happens, what trajectories,

01:25:26.310 --> 01:25:27.480
what growth trajectories,

01:25:27.480 --> 01:25:30.630
what consumption patterns
are associated with the type

01:25:30.630 --> 01:25:32.550
