01:25:41.910 --> 01:25:43.860
And I think, yeah, as Esther was saying,

01:25:43.860 --> 01:25:47.340
we've been talking too much
about this, the second point,

01:25:47.340 --> 01:25:51.210
national state versus
a global social state.

01:25:51.210 --> 01:25:55.860
Well, I think first there
